# promise: #386
# Tabs picked with ⌘/⇧-click open side by side from the picked-tabs menu's Open in Split View, as
# Arc's does: one split of the picks in sidebar order, the first pick focused, the picks dropped.
# Today lists the newest tab first: three, two, one.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=one
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=two
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=three
wait 2
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=split&run=Open in Split View
expect-log picked menu split ran Open in Split View: - picks=0$
wait 1
cra://debug?split=picked
expect-log split picked: panes=\S+n=three \| \S+n=two selected=\S+n=three downloads=0$
